        "description": "Identification of pathogenic mutations in the GSR gene",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "exclusion-other-causes",
        "description": "Exclusion of other enzymopathies and hemoglobinopathies causing hemolytic anemia",
